webgpu (language wgsl): runs the kernel
  cpu-only kernel: refuses
metal (language msl): runs the kernel
  cpu-only kernel: refuses
vulkan (language glsl): falls back to the CPU
  cpu-only kernel: refuses
d3d12 (language hlsl): runs the kernel
  cpu-only kernel: refuses
cpu (language zig): runs the kernel
  cpu-only kernel: runs
lower(webgpu) -> source
lower(metal) -> source
lower(vulkan) -> source
lower(d3d12) -> source
lower(cpu) -> null
